  "solution": {
    "text": "Here <math><mtext>Z</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> (4d) and <math><mtext>H</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> (5d) are having same size which is possible due to poor screening effect by inner d or f orbitals electrons due to highly diffused shape of these orbitals or lanthanide contraction in <math> <mrow> <mtext>Hf</mtext></mrow> </math>."
